// through BattleFx_MagicIce3MultiBuildDebrisFromTexturedTriangles, BattleFx_MagicIce3MultiBuildDebrisFromTexturedQuads, BattleFx_MagicIce3MultiBuildDebrisFromShadedTriangles and BattleFx_MagicIce3MultiBuildDebrisFromShadedQuads, and returns no result.
